# LeakSanitizer suppressions for third-party allocations that live for the whole
# process. Never add engine code here: fix the leak instead.
#
# SDL3's X11 backend and Xlib allocate caches during SDL_Init (display modes,
# keyboard maps) that are intentionally never freed.
leak:X11_InitModes
leak:X11_InitKeyboard
leak:X11_VideoInit
leak:SDL_VideoInit
# Xlib text-property conversion used by SDL_SetWindowTitle on X11.
leak:_Xutf8TextListToTextProperty
